# Agent-framework working state (Instar, nanoclaw, OpenClaw).
# These frameworks are optional for developing this client and are not required
# to build, test or run it — nothing in src/ or packages/ imports them. Claude
# Remote Control now covers the need Instar was adopted for. Their state is
# local scratch, so it is ignored rather than committed; a checkout must not
# imply a framework.
.instar/
.nanoclaw/
.openclaw/
.swarm/
.claude-flow/
